{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 3760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2219, "text": "Okay, Miss Sullivan, you need a stick."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 11420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10420, "text": "It's a stick."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 15180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12260, "text": "Sorry, Dad. No, it's quite all right.\nThey needed a good rinsing out anyway."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 17400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16260, "text": "Is that a bacon bit?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 20800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19800, "text": "Hey, everybody."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 23620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 20880, "text": "I want you to meet the new bailiff who's\ngoing to be working with us for a few"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 25360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23620, "text": "days. This is Rosalind Russell."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 34800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33680, "text": "Russell, that's a neat name."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 37140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35100, "text": "My mother was a show business freak. Ah."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 39760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37420, "text": "I do, however, feel more fortunate than\nmy sister."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 41100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40100, "text": "Ja, ja."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 44480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43040, "text": "Oh, the poor thing."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 46340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45280, "text": "That's what my brother says."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 48380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46820, "text": "Your brother... Flappy."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 54360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50080, "text": "Uh, sir, sir. Uh, post office delivered\nthis letter for you."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 56500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55500, "text": "Special delivery."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 59320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58320, "text": "Special? Yeah."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 63080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59820, "text": "Mac, this letter is dated April 16th,\n1971."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 65259, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64360, "text": "They did."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 66260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65260, "text": "They were sorry."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 70080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67240, "text": "Mac, I should have gotten this letter\nthree presidents ago."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 72580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71580, "text": "Open it up!"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 81100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80100, "text": "Who's it from?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 83360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82140, "text": "It's from my mother."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 85620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84620, "text": "Oh, my..."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 91650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87950, "text": "No, Harry's mother abandoned him when he\nwas five years old. He hasn't seen her"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 92650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91650, "text": "in 30 years."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 95430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92850, "text": "My brother hasn't seen my mother in over\n30 years."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 98210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95910, "text": "Your brother... Topo Zizo."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 145150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142030, "text": "I can't even imagine what it must be\nlike growing up without a mother."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 149830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146190, "text": "I remember crying and screaming the\nfirst time my mother ever left me alone."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 151710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150710, "text": "Kindergarten?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 153070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152070, "text": "Basic training."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 157830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154890, "text": "If the drill sergeant hadn't looked\nexactly like her."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 163170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160870, "text": "But he did, Bull. That's what counts."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 167950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 166730, "text": "Ready when you are, sir."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 169350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168330, "text": "Yeah, thank you, ma 'am."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 171740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 170099, "text": "Oh, come on, sir."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 175500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172680, "text": "Let's go throw some people in prison.\nThat always cheers you up."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 178180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 177120, "text": "Max, listen to this."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 183880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178980, "text": "I'd like a chance to explain what\nhappened, but I will understand if you"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 184880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183880, "text": "want to see me."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 186700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185340, "text": "Love, your mother."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 192520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187640, "text": "She probably thinks I don't want to see\nher. Well, that's a Manhattan return"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 193840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 192520, "text": "address. You going to look for her?"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 195240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194240, "text": "Oh, I don't know."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 196740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195740, "text": "I haven't decided."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 202250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 200910, "text": "I'll be fine, Matt, really."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 206190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 202550, "text": "All rise. I have prepared myself for any\ncontingency."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 214850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 208550, "text": "Except that one."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 218530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216330, "text": "Criminal court part two is now in\nsession."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 221210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218890, "text": "The Honorable Harold T. Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 226150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222690, "text": "You may be seated, or boxed, as the case\nmay be."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 233110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229230, "text": "Well, I'm behind myself, and really I\nam. I guess I always knew that"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 234710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233110, "text": "I was going to have to deal with it."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 236910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234970, "text": "Can we have some quiet, please?"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 239690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238250, "text": "Hey! Hey!"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 241430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240430, "text": "Hey! Hey!"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 247450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245170, "text": "Mac? Sir? What's with the walnut people?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 252360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250320, "text": "Acquaintances of the defendants, sir.\nWho are?"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 256399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252720, "text": "Maury Blaze, Dixie Lord, Dennis Small,\nand friends."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 259000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256820, "text": "Hey, I want to see my lawyer."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 262380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259360, "text": "Quiet. I demand a jury of my peers."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 267260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264040, "text": "We're going to roast weenies with you\nand your peers if you don't put a sock"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 268260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267260, "text": "there."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 273080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270860, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor, what is the story here?"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 277320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273340, "text": "Well, Your Honor, there was an audition\nfor a host of a local TV kiddie show."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 279060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277700, "text": "A riot broke out."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 280540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279420, "text": "The police arrested these three."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 283760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281440, "text": "Hey, who's the foxy blonde on the end?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 285840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284460, "text": "Hey, not bad, huh?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 291700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288480, "text": "I wouldn't kick her out of my suitcase."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 295140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293940, "text": "I plead guilty."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 297560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296560, "text": "Who said that?"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 300180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299180, "text": "And you are?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 302520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 300500, "text": "My name is Dennis Small."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 307500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303820, "text": "Mac, is there any law that would make\nhim move his lips in court?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 313360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310760, "text": "Sir, nothing's in the Constitution about\norifice manipulation."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 317060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316060, "text": "Here you go, sir."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 318099, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317340, "text": "What's this?"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 319200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318100, "text": "Your mother's phone number."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 323360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319640, "text": "Oh. She's moved a couple of times since\nthe letter, but I tracked her down with"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 324680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323360, "text": "the help of a friend and motor vehicle."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 327380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324940, "text": "Oh, I haven't even decided what I'm\ngoing to do yet."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 330580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328480, "text": "Sir, I know you."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 334580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331300, "text": "And I know you keep a picture of your\nmother tucked away in your office."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 337820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335380, "text": "Just like I keep one of mine, close to\nme."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 339640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338220, "text": "Your mom drives a tank?"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 344660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343560, "text": "Oh, wrong one."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 350360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349060, "text": "We'll take five, people."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 353000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351820, "text": "Are you going to call her, sir?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 356100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353540, "text": "Oh, I don't know. I'm confused."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 357540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356540, "text": "I'm torn."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 359400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358220, "text": "I'm... Vacillating?"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 366160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365160, "text": "Eerie, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 375290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374190, "text": "don't you have a dummy like the others?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 381630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376670, "text": "A successful act depends upon the\npersonality of the figure and the"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 386850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381630, "text": "between he and a ventriloquist. I have\nhoned my skills, but I haven't yet found"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 387910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386850, "text": "that perfect other character."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 391790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388150, "text": "Until I do, I refuse to speak as myself."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 395950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394230, "text": "I think I understand."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 399410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398310, "text": "You're very kind."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 401230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400230, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 402610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401610, "text": "It's all right."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 413800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410860, "text": "Jan, this was a very difficult decision\nfor me to make."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 419760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415660, "text": "Yeah? All right, then. Perhaps it would\njust be the best thing for both of us if"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 421240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419760, "text": "I hang up the phone right now."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 424660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423660, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 426360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425360, "text": "You're right, I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 429100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427420, "text": "Thank you, operator. I'll dial direct."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 436260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433660, "text": "Don't ever do that to me again."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 440140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438280, "text": "You want me to dial your mother for you,\nsir?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 442840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440780, "text": "No, no, thank you, Mac. I can do this\nmyself."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 462180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461180, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 465980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 464980, "text": "Hello?"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 470080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467320, "text": "This is Harry T. Stone calling."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 477580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470620, "text": "And I... I... I'd like to"}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 478580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477580, "text": "talk to my mother."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 481680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480680, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 483220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482060, "text": "Oh, oh, I understand."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 485120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 483860, "text": "No, no, I do. I do."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 487020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485340, "text": "Yes, thank you very much. Thank you."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 496540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495540, "text": "She's not there?"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 498040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497040, "text": "She's dead."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 514600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511760, "text": "Sir, I'm so very sorry. You have my\ndeepest condolences."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 520500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518880, "text": "Obviously, you're taking it very well."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 523080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522080, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 526560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523539, "text": "Too much for the eyebrows, huh? Oh, no,\nsir. Not on you."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 529940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527140, "text": "I can suck up and grieve at the same\ntime, okay?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 535300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532220, "text": "Hey, guys, if you wouldn't mind, I'd\nlike a couple of minutes alone, huh? Oh,"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 537480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535300, "text": "understand, sir. Because I'm going to\ntry these on."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 541620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540080, "text": "the traditional shorts of mourning."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 547640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546240, "text": "Mike, stop it."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 550400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548040, "text": "I want you dead, Lori."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 554580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550840, "text": "Get your little hands off of him."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 559620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558260, "text": "What's going on here?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 562580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559880, "text": "The jerk just didn't get it through his\nhead. It's over."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 564360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563360, "text": "What's over?"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 570360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569260, "text": "Why are you breaking up the act?"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 572820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570680, "text": "Why? Yeah. Isn't it obvious?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 574580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573400, "text": "Look at his lips."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 583840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 581120, "text": "I've seen less movement on a roller\ncoaster."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 587900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585980, "text": "Does that mean we're through?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 590960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588180, "text": "Listen, let's go get the number of that\nSonny Bono crisis line."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 604690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603690, "text": "comfortable these days."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 608570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605330, "text": "I really don't mean to interfere."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 609810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608810, "text": "But you're gonna."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 611170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610170, "text": "Yes, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 616510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611650, "text": "Sir, if someone didn't know you, they\nmight think you were awfully indifferent"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 617710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616510, "text": "to your mother's death."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 620410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619290, "text": "And they'd be right."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 622930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621770, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 626530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623310, "text": "Miss Sullivan, let's not get started on\nsomething that might damage our"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 627570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626530, "text": "relationship, huh?"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 630810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628650, "text": "Sir, your mother is dead."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 633070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631090, "text": "There's no shame in showing your grief."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 639270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633670, "text": "Okay, so what kind of grief am I\nsupposed to show for a woman who dumped"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 642630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639270, "text": "five -year -old boy the way another\nwoman dumped her garbage?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 649330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644970, "text": "Bill, I can't believe you're not capable\nof feeling any loss. I am capable of"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 650330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649330, "text": "feeling loss."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 654170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650790, "text": "When Thelma died, I felt loss."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 657950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654790, "text": "When Florence died, I felt loss."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 662150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658590, "text": "Because I cared very much for them, and\nthey cared for me."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 666520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 662700, "text": "If I needed comfort and compassion, they\nwere there."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 671400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667420, "text": "If I just needed a friend to talk to,\nthey were there."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 679200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672980, "text": "But when I needed a mother, no one was\nthere."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 687500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684000, "text": "He said he wanted to take a nap and he\nkicked me out of his office. You sound"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 688500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 687500, "text": "upset."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 690650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688670, "text": "Is there anything I can do?"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 693990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690870, "text": "Yeah, why don't you throw your voice\ninto the elevator shaft and follow it?"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 699110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696250, "text": "I like the silk underwear, it's the\nonly... Hey, get out of there!"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 725270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724270, "text": "want to disturb you."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 728390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726390, "text": "You did a real good job."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 732410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730490, "text": "You're a fine -looking young man."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 735430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733790, "text": "Thank you very much."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 743510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741770, "text": "Want to know who the hell I am?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 750350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 746210, "text": "Well, since you brought it up, sure."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 752190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751190, "text": "Buddy."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 756920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755920, "text": "Mary Stone."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 758860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757860, "text": "Yeah, I know."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 760380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758940, "text": "I was married to your mother."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 764080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763080, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 768280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765540, "text": "Then that would make us... nothing."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 772240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770880, "text": "Right, I had a father."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 776120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773860, "text": "Well, what can I do for you, Mr. Ryan?"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 777660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776380, "text": "Oh, no, please, buddy."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 779520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777960, "text": "I insist. Fine, buddy."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 781980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779780, "text": "Hey, buddy, what do you want, buddy? Me?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 783580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782520, "text": "I don't want anything."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 785160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783800, "text": "I thought you might want something."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 786370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 785370, "text": "Like what?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 788390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786870, "text": "Information about your mother."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 792330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788830, "text": "You see, we were married for 23 years."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 795170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793270, "text": "She was a wonderful woman."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 797570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796410, "text": "I wouldn't know."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 800830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798290, "text": "Oh, yeah. I guess you weren't that\nclose."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 804210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801150, "text": "Not close? Hell, I got a letter from her\njust today."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 807170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804530, "text": "What? It was sent 15 years ago."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 811830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807890, "text": "I told her special delivery was no\nfaster than the regular service."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 818580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814440, "text": "Look, I'm really very busy, Mr., uh...\nUh, uh, uh... Buddy."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 821360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 819160, "text": "Buddy. Would you mind, Buddy?"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 826180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822040, "text": "Oh, no, no, no, no, no, sure. I, uh, I\njust thought you might be curious."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 829180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826820, "text": "Yeah. I'm curious, Buddy."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 834760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829660, "text": "I'm curious about how any woman in her\nright mind would abandon a husband and a"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 835840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834760, "text": "five -year -old boy."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 837740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836480, "text": "Uh, uh, Jackpot!"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 841040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838920, "text": "Did I mention that I am armed?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 844920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841420, "text": "You just... Said the magic words. This\nis no ordinary stapler."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 848680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845740, "text": "Why would any woman in her right mind do\nthat? Answer!"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 850880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848920, "text": "She wasn't in her right mind."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 855780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854540, "text": "You're saying she was sick?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 857480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 856480, "text": "For a while."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 858900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857720, "text": "Then she got better."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 866140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 860200, "text": "Harry, she went into a psychiatric\ninstitution after she left you."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 869960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868880, "text": "That's where we met."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 878140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876520, "text": "I'm going to go out on a limb here."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 882180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879960, "text": "You weren't on the staff, were you?"}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 889620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886640, "text": "But I'm feeling much better now."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 894500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893020, "text": "Could you go to dinner with me tonight?"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 899360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897660, "text": "Do you open your mouth when you eat?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 901960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899620, "text": "Or do you just suck food in through your\nnostril?"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 905380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904380, "text": "Then you'll go?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 907650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906210, "text": "No, I won't go."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 911790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908670, "text": "Is it because I won't move my lips when\nI talk?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 939360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936200, "text": "stuff. Would you like to help me? Sure,\nI would. Come on. We're going to talk."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 940580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939580, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 944120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943120, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 946580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945240, "text": "I'm leaving now, Bill."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 948220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947220, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 949540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948540, "text": "Goodbye."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 954180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950220, "text": "How many guys can say their parole\nofficer is their best friend, too?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 957820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956060, "text": "Did Mike come through here?"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 961560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960560, "text": "Mike?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 963240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962240, "text": "The dummy?"}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 967470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963580, "text": "Yeah, we went up on the roof to talk.\nthings out and it got a little heated"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 969150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 967470, "text": "he just stormed off."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 973330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972330, "text": "Stormed off?"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 976290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973930, "text": "As in a departure of some sort?"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1004030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002090, "text": "Was always talking to the light\nfixtures."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1006170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005070, "text": "What happened to him?"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1008050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006430, "text": "Now? Oh, I don't know."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1011030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008530, "text": "He was Secretary of State there for a\nwhile."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1016510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013230, "text": "My point is, everyone has a story."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1020910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017210, "text": "Listen, buddy, I really... Your mother\nwas only 16 when she had you."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1031970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029450, "text": "She had a pretty rough childhood, from\nwhat I understand."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1035490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033329, "text": "Beatings, mistreatment."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1037290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036290, "text": "Her parents?"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1040170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038950, "text": "That surprise you?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1046329, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043230, "text": "In this job, I've seen that sort of\nthing a thousand times."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1049990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048290, "text": "It always surprises me."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1055690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052090, "text": "She was a volunteer with kids like that\nher whole life."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1064780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057960, "text": "Said it could never make up for what she\ndid to you, but... maybe some other"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1071700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064780, "text": "kid might be saved from... from having"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1073980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071700, "text": "to learn to love somebody he never met."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1078820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077000, "text": "Have I told you this story before?"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1085900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084300, "text": "Buddy, I never did know her."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1090100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088560, "text": "But I'm beginning to miss her."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1094300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092740, "text": "And how do you think I feel?"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1108700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105180, "text": "How do you... Lady, you're busy\nmassaging a man in a cheap suit."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1118260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117260, "text": "Are you okay, buddy?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1120740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1119160, "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah. I'm fine."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1123480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122480, "text": "Tell me something."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1129060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125300, "text": "Did my mother know about me?"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1130780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129620, "text": "That you were a judge?"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1132260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131260, "text": "Sure."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1134560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132580, "text": "She used to read about you in the\npapers."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1138340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135000, "text": "In fact, I think she even came here\nonce. To court? Yeah."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1139580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138580, "text": "Well, then maybe I saw her."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1141740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139780, "text": "Maybe. You got a recent picture?"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1146680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142020, "text": "As a matter of fact, there's one of the\ntwo of us."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1148580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147240, "text": "At Niagara Falls."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1150160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149140, "text": "Where are you?"}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1151400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150400, "text": "In the barrel."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1159400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156980, "text": "But I'm feeling much better now."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1176900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1174540, "text": "Yes, we can become very attached to our\nlumber."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1185540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179640, "text": "To go under these circumstances, what if\nthere's an inquest?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1192060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190640, "text": "I'll take care of it."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1193580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192520, "text": "Oh, thank you."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1198240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195340, "text": "For once, I need to be alone."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1209300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208300, "text": "Is he gone?"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1217540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216540, "text": "Boy,"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1224180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223180, "text": "she is beautiful."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1228880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224960, "text": "Sir, do I have time to run down to the\nuniform shop? We need some buttons for"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1229439, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228880, "text": "his sleeve."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1230440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229440, "text": "Sure, Bull."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1234020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231040, "text": "Bull, you need buttons for whose sleeve?"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1235840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234840, "text": "His."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1246450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245290, "text": "wanting like a clean getaway."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1252330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250570, "text": "Well, what do you think?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1255950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253150, "text": "Congratulations, Mr. Small. I think you\nfinally found yourself."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1258310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256770, "text": "Now will you go to dinner with me?"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1260150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1259150, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1262510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260970, "text": "Never in a million years."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1264790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263790, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1283250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280650, "text": "Well, give me a couple of minutes, Mac.\nI want to say goodbye to Buddy."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1284530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283530, "text": "Of course."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1287190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286190, "text": "Sir."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1290910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287850, "text": "I knew you weren't a cold, sadistic\nscumbuck at all, Warren."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1293210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292210, "text": "I thank you."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1296870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295370, "text": "And my mom thanks you."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1309670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305310, "text": "Well, uh... I guess I'll see you around,\nHarry."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1312610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1310490, "text": "Anytime, buddy. And I mean that."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1314610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312930, "text": "Anytime. How about tomorrow?"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1315930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1314930, "text": "No, not tomorrow."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1317990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316990, "text": "I'll call."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1319450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1318030, "text": "Okay. Hey."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1323390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320630, "text": "Oh, I almost forgot. Here."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1325689, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1324690, "text": "What's that?"}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1332490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325690, "text": "A present from your mother. She said if\nI ever ran into you... Something the"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1333490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332490, "text": "matter?"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1338890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333730, "text": "You got your mother's compassion, but\nyou're so different."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1344460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340780, "text": "I wonder what would have happened if\nshe'd have raised you."}
